This directory contains the mdict-cpp parser from https://github.com/dictlab/mdict-cpp,
commit 6661d75d443a2cd24f23f548e4586b677b628346, downloaded on 2026-09-27.
Its BSD-3-Clause license and AUTHORS file are included.

Okular builds this copy by default for desktop and mobile builds.
Set OKULAR_USE_BUNDLED_MDICT=OFF to use a platform mdict-cpp package instead.
Okular's parser uses owned, bounded buffers, validates checksums and file sizes,
and decodes key blocks on demand. It uses Qt Core for XML and text decoding and
platform zlib for decompression. The C API catches all parser exceptions.
Supported formats are MDX 1.x/2.x with UTF-8 or UTF-16 text, uncompressed or zlib
blocks, and optional key-info encryption (Encrypted=2). Password encryption and
LZO compression are unsupported. Individual blocks are limited to 64 MiB and
definitions to 1 MiB. Dictionary data and the upstream CLI are omitted.
